@startuml
title US-003 - Activate member account - SD level 3 - Frontend
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Invited Person" as Person
participant "ActivateAccountPage" as View
participant "ActivateAccountForm" as Component
participant "authService" as Service
participant "HttpClient" as Http
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over View, API
  Password flow only. OAuth endpoints and session delivery\nafter activation are not yet specified.
end note

Person -> View: Open the email link (email and link token in the URL)
activate View
note right of View
  Requires both "token" and "email" query params,
  or redirects to "/" (RequireSearchParam guard).
end note
View -> Person: Render the invitation code entry (name/password hidden)
deactivate View

Person -> Component: Type/paste the 6-character invitation code
activate Component
Component -> Service: verifyInvitation(email, linkToken, code)
activate Service
Service -> Http: POST /accounts/activation/verify (VerifyInvitationDto)
activate Http
Http -> API: HTTP request
activate API
alt Link token and code valid
    API --> Http: 200 OK
else Link token or code wrong/expired
    API --> Http: 403/409
end
deactivate API
Http --> Service: Response or rejected request
deactivate Http
Service --> Component: Success, or thrown error
deactivate Service
alt Verified
    Component --> Person: Code entry replaced by a confirmation, then name/password fields
else Rejected
    Component --> Person: "Invitation is not valid" (code entry stays, Resend invitation offered)
end
deactivate Component

Person -> Component: Submit name and password
activate Component
Component -> Service: activate({email, linkToken, code, name, password})
activate Service
Service -> Http: POST /accounts/activation (ActivateAccountDto)
activate Http
Http -> API: HTTP request
activate API
alt Request accepted
    API --> Http: 200 OK (AccountDto)
else Request rejected
    API --> Http: 400/403/409/500
end
deactivate API
Http --> Service: Response data or rejected request
deactivate Http
Service --> Component: Success, or thrown error
deactivate Service
alt Successful response
    Component --> Person: Redirect to /login?activated=1
else Failed response (403/409)
    Component --> Person: Error state; code entry step is shown again
else Failed response (400/500)
    Component --> Person: Error state (validation / operation failure)
end
deactivate Component
@enduml
